<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-STEAUA BEAT NATIONAL 4-2 TO WIN ROMANIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STEAUA BEAT NATIONAL 4-2 TO WIN ROMANIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steaua Bucharest beat F.C. National Bucharest 4-2 (halftime 3-1) in the final of the Romanian Cup on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Steaua - Sabin Ilie 2, 5, 29 pen, Cristian Ciocoiu 87</p>
<p>F.C. National - Marin Duna 11, Petre Tinel 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
